  "prefLabel": "Gen 403.02 Licensing Process if a License Has Been Expired More Than One Year",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 403.02 Licensing Process if a License Has Been Expired More Than One Year. An individual whose license has been expired more than one year who wishes to obtain a license shall apply pursuant to Plc 312.03.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
